WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:02,820
I'm really asking you if you're human.

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:06,820
How dare you curse me to death?

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:20,520
old thing

4
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,520
You pull the iron rod, right?

5
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,520
you bastard

6
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,520
Why are you chasing him?

7
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,900
because of him

8
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,040
Otherwise, this life and death will not end

9
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,040
Butt has no seat

10
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,040
It's time to replace someone

11
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,100
What are you rolling your eyes at?

12
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,100
Have you not become a better person?

13
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,100
He called me not a human being

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,820
I have to be real

15
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:45,230
I need to find him to express my gratitude.

16
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,230
If you don’t believe it, ask the disciples around you

17
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:53,680
Did they all hear it?

18
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,000
That's not what he said

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,000
I didn't scold him

20
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
I really thought he was not human
